{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_title", "source_sha256": "2fa65fadb97fbd81e22e07a02ff25b8766275b2a22ce788548e559d375faede8", "ja": "こちら、方針決まり次第、追加で依頼いたします。", "zh": "这边会在方针确定后，再追加委托。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2fa65fadb97fbd81e22e07a02ff25b8766275b2a22ce788548e559d375faede8", "ja": "こちら、方針決まり次第、追加で依頼いたします。", "zh": "这边会在方针确定后，再追加委托。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1000_p", "source_sha256": "38c574332e22a739e4e795599db66c9d9465251120173189fd494d545e286352", "ja": "可奈、ここにいたのか。\nちょっと話が……。", "zh": "可奈，你在这啊。\n我有话要跟你说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "d3dc59b5fdfd4e4839151521cc55a143d2a3fdc43071947b138b6d3c7bdd9213", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\n私、バンドのボーカルできると思いますか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你觉得我有办法当乐团的主唱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3b6ccaccc64c809a178b7f5fdc14d41971a7ad57241c6b7927157f28cd9f7690", "ja": "バンドのボーカル？\nいきなりなんでそんなことを……。", "zh": "乐团的主唱？\n怎么突然这么问……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "e8989f1f3f63413e9fa936d6c90e170fd61d7fe1a3ffc65ba46b1bc66f583ae8", "ja": "可奈とギターの話をしてたんだ。\nそこからバンドを組もうって話になってさ。", "zh": "我刚刚和可奈在聊吉他，\n然后就提到要不要一起组团这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "bc4e77e6407e004b7c8b2f83de56da665396ef3fa2d64a5a518fd7a82fdcab61", "ja": "おはようございます。", "zh": "大家早。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "9f6a6ce801161cea8bd0fd3df75bbd9ffbd511b421ce55ef329e182fa282be6b", "ja": "志保ちゃん！\nねえねえ私、バンドのボーカル、できるかな？", "zh": "志保！\n欸欸，你觉得我可以当乐团的主唱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "c62bc570a2df0813cbb4e078bb22c971c463843e96847b4b6bdd840d5291126d", "ja": "突然、なんの話……？\n矢吹さん、バンドを組むの？", "zh": "你突然在说些什么……？\n矢吹，你要组团是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "30a56749473992c46e01e330099474d9b35ab53dd80eec8a8efe16afb2ff0fdc", "ja": "もしかしたら！\nねぇねぇ、どう思うっ？", "zh": "可能的话啦！\n欸欸，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "d7179dd2ea449dd29f6530946c5164b548deb4cc97061a52704d2d3935e5c280", "ja": "そうね……。\n別に、やるのは自由だと思うけど。", "zh": "我认为……\n要做与否都是你的自由吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "f36b006d0bb015e212e32702a6a2206fb164129a99c4cdf8a72bf1c14096e0f4", "ja": "自由かぁ～。そうだよねっ。\nやりたいって思う気持ちが、大切だよねっ！", "zh": "自由啊～说得也是！\n重要的还是看自己有没有决心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "927cbbf92597023f236a3cbda5129d2c3393ba5b18a955307f0c5dff1e2aa19e", "ja": "えへへっ、{$P$}さん。\n私、バンドのボーカルやりたいです！", "zh": "嘿嘿，{$P$}先生。\n我想当乐团的主唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ce0e9d0a926cc21a030c10d09a7c7c21dc33ca326b5c8420906259846c01919f", "ja": "ちょうどよかった。バンドじゃないけど、可奈には\n次の公演のセンターをやってもらおうと思ってたんだ。", "zh": "那正好。虽然不是乐团，\n但我想让可奈当下次公演的Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "491c4addb2a3132b42d801fbc255157e394cc561c2eaafae8af8270930e258e5", "ja": "え…………。", "zh": "咦…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "fba010406ecca5325eac4fdc02f3bcaaa53a2b0ce6ca81ce08aabc86a7b55799", "ja": "ええええ～～～～～！？", "zh": "咦咦咦咦～～～～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "087834a483bf18e4f0220e71071237f5aaf7619e0359e82e30b21aac519386a5", "ja": "私が、センターって……。　\nはっ！　もしかして、これって夢なのかも？", "zh": "要我当Center……\n啊！我其实是在做梦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1016_p", "source_sha256": "50f388fcbd57585c6d3b78a1df4e74396581ed65e354c1e3765e774453929a86", "ja": "大丈夫、夢じゃないよ。俺はセンターを、\n可奈に任せたいんだ。……やってくれるか？", "zh": "别担心，这不是梦。\n我是真的想请可奈当Center……你愿意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "68cd07d75ee4467cdaced65d8c2c6b21a6991580c77947221f154cf7e7b074bc", "ja": "は……、はいっ！\n私、力いっぱい頑張ります！", "zh": "好……好的！\n我会尽力而为的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "ea01aefec506de21e7414dcb10fe8eca09bb0ef5a7e710a569672b6263d742bf", "ja": "やったな、可奈！　悔しいけど、今回は譲るよ。\nボーカルレッスン、とことん付き合うぜ！", "zh": "太好了，可奈！虽然有点不甘心，但这次就让给你吧。\n我会陪你一起参加歌唱课程的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "a15e164018dbe0148a1bda126526563dbb7cf64710f2d03e52c20463a2398113", "ja": "ありがとうジュリアさん！　可奈はセンター♪\n燃えているんだ～♪　絶対、成功させるんだ～♪", "zh": "谢谢你，茱莉亚！可奈是Center♪\n可奈斗志满满～♪绝对要让公演成功～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "2bd27e2d5029d06afa92aecfa92b5ecdbb4e9c05448eeb470179858c41c3943f", "ja": "そうですか。\n矢吹さんをセンターに……。", "zh": "这样啊，\n矢吹是Center……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1021_p", "source_sha256": "332d5bc86435130ea0ef11eb79902c07199b632be659a74f87823b3443d0fe4c", "ja": "ん？　どうした志保。", "zh": "嗯？志保你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_014_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_014_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "8304645a6d02ec4b2e9b0b7c646629b786c41ca61b2106291f53f371483b48d0", "ja": "……まあ、いいです。\nそれじゃ、失礼します。", "zh": "……也好，没事。\n那我先离开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
